From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1066/1066] SableOS: FM recording started from Sable Media shows
 a Recording and Stop notification

The stock recording notification (the time, "Recording in progress" and a STOP
RECORDING button) is posted by the FM Radio recording screen, which is not open
when Sable Media starts the recording through the bridge. The bridge now posts it
itself while the recording runs, on the lock screen too, and its Stop button ends
and saves the recording. The playing notification returns when the recording is
saved.
---
diff --git a/src/com/android/fmradio/SableFmBridgeService.java b/src/com/android/fmradio/SableFmBridgeService.java
--- a/src/com/android/fmradio/SableFmBridgeService.java
+++ b/src/com/android/fmradio/SableFmBridgeService.java
@@ -16,6 +16,10 @@
 
